{"version":1,"content":"<p>距離蘋果預計在2027年春季發佈新一批iPhone產品還有數月時間，但首批iPhone Air 2與iPhone 18模型機照片已經提前流出。從曝光內容來看，新機整體設計基本符合此前傳聞，沒有出現太多意外變化，不過iPhone Air系列最受關注的一項短板似乎終於得到改善。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587322.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:24:32.589781+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T17:10:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T17:17:39.549462+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T17:17:39.549462+00:00","content_hash":"47947b4f314493d99212d0e8a53fa97a552352d817934ce3c9550ecc296fa383","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}